<tbody><tr>
<td><b>NOTE:</b> This is a historical version of a<br />document which may have a more<br />current version. You may want to<br />refer to this <b><a href="/wiki/National_Platform" title="National Platform">list of versions</a></b><br />if you are interested in more<br />recent information.
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>The <b>2008 National <a href="/wiki/Libertarian_Party_platform" class="mw-redirect" title="Libertarian Party platform">Platform</a> of the Libertarian Party</b> was adopted in May of 2008, in Denver, Colorado.
</p><p>Below is the text of the 2008 National Platform of the Libertarian Party.
</p>
